<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 558.50, up 5.59.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 280 to 233.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.13.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,427,090 compared with 19,138,290 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>   (Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>   ((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
